WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.900
It's almost the time of the culture fair...

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.980
And we will be making a race!

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.180
A race?

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.000
Yup!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.320
For trying to get people to come
to the bike club, it's perfect for us!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.840
That idea sounds delightful.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.410
What a display of our renegade-ness that would be.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.510
I get it. If we hold a race,

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:20.870
we could possibly get more
people to learn about bikes.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:24.750
But how are we going to deal
with all those new riders.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.830
It'll be a pain for us.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:30.870
Just do a crepe or takoyaki stand or something.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.700
Well, I think the ones <i>in</i> the Bike Club
should be the ones to decide.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.220
Let's race together, Rin-chan!

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:45.190
Well, only because you asked.

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:47.250
It's okay, right, Onsa-chan?

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.670
I guess it is.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.890
It'll be more fun with more competitors.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.130
I'm glad.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.590
Okay, back to work.

00:00:55.590 --> 00:01:00.030
Now we should figure out how
to make the race appealing.

