00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.590
buon!  buon!  buon!  buon!  buoon!

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:27.510
todorokima~su, bakuon!!

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:34.760
Next time on Bakuon!!
Cultural Festival!!

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:39.770
<b>This program is fiction. Some dangerous behaviors were
